[[0,1352751,0,1,2,-1,"2016-10-18T00:51:34","SavedGameStudios","",[],"","My Vid.Me Channel - Stop by for a visit","https://vid.me/SavedGameStudios","ContentCreators"],[1,6589352,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T00:53:16","SavedGameStudios","",[],"<p>Hi all, just kicking off the sub with a link to my channel on Vid.Me. While I do have a YouTube channel, I was very late to the LP and video creation phenomenon and so am making very little money there. I think I will push my stuff on Vid.Me right now because of the wonderful community they have built, and the cancerous mess that YouTube and Google have created. </p>\n<p>If you have a channel you would like to share, please comment below or make your own post on the sub. Thanks!</p>"],[1,6591118,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T05:20:07","Artofchoke","",[],"<p>I've also been looking for a video host, thank you! Will check it out! ♡</p>"]]
