[[0,1352760,0,1,1,0,"2016-10-18T00:59:54","Kannibal","",[],"","Some Trump supporters fell for a hoax by a troll pretending to to be a post office worker destroying ballots","http://www.dailydot.com/unclick/trump-drudge-post-office-troll/","whatever"],[1,6589406,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T01:00:07","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/ik4A8\">https://archive.is/ik4A8</a> : \n</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Prominent Trump Supporters Extremely Mad Over Troll's Tweet About Destroying Ballots | The Daily Dot </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&quot;No one could possibly mistake Randy's gag, making light of Trump supporters' paranoia, for a serious admission.&quot; </p>\n<p>'Either way, someone named Randy G Dub is not a post office employee trying to steal the election from Donald Trump. ', &quot; The United States Postal Service has confirmed it:Although this forced a retraction from Drudge, Randy's mentions are still a very funny shitstorm, the well-deserved treasure of a successful troll.R.I.P Randy's menchies.&quot;, &quot;In the context of Donald Trump's ongoing campaign to convince America the presidential election is rigged, someone on Weird Twitter made a joke:Ha ha!&quot;, &quot;It's funny because no one who actually intended to tamper with ballots would tweet about it.&quot; </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/u0eLPL.jpg\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6589435,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T01:03:27","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>Gullible idiots. </p>"]]
[[0,1352761,0,171,19,152,"2016-10-18T01:00:03","antiliberalsociety","",[],"","Truer Words Have Never Been Spoken","https://i.sli.mg/vOuRIY.png","politics"],[1,6589754,0,3,5,-2,"2016-10-18T01:49:38","blackguard19","",[],"<p>Good quote I guess, but screw that anti-white street-shitter. </p>"],[2,6589864,6589754,0,4,-4,"2016-10-18T02:04:57","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>How is he?</p>"],[3,6590348,6589864,2,1,1,"2016-10-18T03:14:09","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>Just fine I think, how are you?</p>"],[4,6590509,6590348,1,3,-2,"2016-10-18T03:32:31","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>how is he anti white you downvoting fuck </p>"],[5,6590517,6590509,2,0,2,"2016-10-18T03:34:19","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>I didn't down vote you, I didn't realize that's what you're into. I can fix that if you like.</p>"],[6,6590533,6590517,0,3,-3,"2016-10-18T03:36:48","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>ANSWER MY QUESTION OR SO HELP ME</p>\n<p>I WILL SHIT IN YOU</p>"],[7,6590561,6590533,1,1,0,"2016-10-18T03:40:53","lord_nougat","[e]",[],"<p>Lol!</p>\n<p>How the fuck should I know, I don't know that faggot.</p>\n<p>But I guess you can still shit into me. Even though that sounds disgusting, I've never tried it, and I don't like to dismiss ideas out of hand without gaining some real insight. </p>"],[8,6590608,6590561,1,3,-2,"2016-10-18T03:47:59","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>Go back to reddit. </p>"],[9,6590610,6590608,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T03:48:25","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>No.</p>"],[10,6590614,6590610,0,2,-2,"2016-10-18T03:49:03","jewsbadnews","",[],"<p>Faggots not allowed. </p>"],[11,6590625,6590614,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T03:50:33","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>Of course you're allowed! Why should we disallow your faggotry? It can be amusing!</p>"],[7,6590573,6590533,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T03:42:41","lord_nougat","",[],"<p>Also, I am sorry, even though I guess you love downvotes, I had to upvoat that because it's fucking hilarious. </p>"],[1,6589939,0,9,1,8,"2016-10-18T02:16:21","peacegnome","",[],"<p>from his wikipedia page:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In January 2014, D'Souza was indicted on felony charges for campaign finance fraud, knowingly making illegal political contributions to a 2012 United States Senate campaign.[13][14] On May 20, 2014, D'Souza pleaded guilty in the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York to one charge of using a &quot;straw donor&quot; to make an illegal political campaign donation. On September 23, D'Souza was sentenced to eight months in a halfway house near his home in San Diego, five years probation, and a $30,000 fine</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So he probably really hates clinton right now for all the shit she is getting away with.</p>"],[2,6591144,6589939,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T05:25:39","Artofchoke","",[],"<p>I too prefer people who dont get captured. </p>"],[2,6594117,6589939,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T17:06:20","neogag","",[],"<p>He claims that the legality of what he did is arguable, and he was the first person in history to be prosecuted for what he did, and that he was singled out because of his movie Obama's America.</p>"],[1,6589972,0,5,1,4,"2016-10-18T02:21:06","8_billion_eaters","",[],"<p>...and that's why they have, periodically, been targeted for elimination throughout history. The real people will tolerate them only so much. \r</p>\n<p>Then they will be cleansed. ...all the way up to the top.</p>"],[1,6590015,0,9,1,8,"2016-10-18T02:25:28","Gargilius","",[],"<p>They didn't just pervert the word 'tolerance' but also, amusingly enough 'diversity'; 'diversity' in their mind means more people just like them, certainly not people who might think differently.</p>"],[2,6590074,6590015,4,0,4,"2016-10-18T02:33:29","SirRender","",[],"<p>It's identity politics, diversity in the liberal mind means skin color, not thought.</p>"],[3,6591725,6590074,2,0,2,"2016-10-18T08:50:54","Gargilius","",[],"<p>...which makes them the racists if you think about it for a mn.</p>"],[1,6591139,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T05:24:47","Artofchoke","",[],"<p>My liberal tolerance ends where other people get hurt, or are forced into anything. \r</p>\n<p>Better words would be &quot;your right to swing your fist ends at my face.&quot;</p>"],[1,6591285,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T05:57:19","Fagtardicus","[e]",[],"<p>the paradox falls apart very quickly once you learn of the jew though</p>"],[1,6592081,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T11:04:48","ScreaminMime","[e]",[],"<p>It only extends to Transexuals who are Marxists. Let one come out as a conservative and they're a fag, sick, confused, likely pedophiles, and a host of other derogatoriness.</p>"],[1,6592585,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T13:05:21","crustyjuggler","",[],"<p>I love the quote, but &quot;no shit&quot;. It's the Oppression Olympics for these people.</p>"],[1,6592891,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-18T13:53:25","Zaqwert","",[],"<p>Famous Saying: Think Liberals are tolerant? Try disagreeing with one.</p>"],[1,6595568,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-18T20:15:39","CaptainBaudnipper","",[],"<p>Who cares about him. Dinesh is a massive cockhead. </p>"]]
